SUMMARY:Men's Breakfast Discussion Group
DESCRIPTION:The Men’s Breakfast Discussion Group (Men’s Breakfast for short) welcomes all men to join us the second Saturday of each month for a potluck breakfast followed by group discussion on a reflective topping chosen by our members. The Breakfast begins at 8 AM\, followed by our discussion from 9 to 11 AM. \nIf you cannot attend the discussion in person\, you are welcomed to join us via Zoom. We continue to meet during the summer months. \nContact Carroll Canipe at canipecarroll@gmail.com for more information and Charlie St. Clair at charlie42stclair@gmail.com for information and the Zoom link. We hope you can join us for the opportunity for great fellowship and food!
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/mens-breakfast-discussion-group-2nd-saturday/2026-09-12/
LOCATION:23 Ed Board\, 23 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:*Social Groups - LOVING
ORGANIZER;CN="Carroll Canipe":MAILTO:canipecarroll@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
