SUMMARY:What in the World is Buddhism? One-Day Retreat
DESCRIPTION:What in the World is Buddhism? A One-Day Retreat \nA one-day course introducing Buddhism and Buddhist Meditation grounded in the Buddha’s lectures given 2600 years ago will be led by David Dixon\, who has led some of our UU Asheville Sangha events of late. Topics include a historic overview\, explanations of the different versions of Buddhism in the US\, and key concepts. You will gain an understanding of the Four Noble Truths\, which include the Noble 8-fold Path. Please bring a sack lunch\, meditation gear if you have it\, and colorful socks! \nQuestions? Contact David
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/what-in-the-world-is-buddhism-one-day-retreat/
LOCATION:*1 Sanctuary\, 1 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:*Faith Formation - LEARNING,Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Buddha-Statue-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="David Dixon":MAILTO:dcd@davidcdixon.com
END:VEVENT
